' =====================================================================
'  DATA FLOW DIAGRAM (DFD) — Road Freight TMS
'  Graduation thesis — Trinh Cong Duc
'
'  Convention (Vietnamese academic standard / Gane-Sarson adapted):
'    - External entity : sharp-cornered rectangle
'    - Process         : ELLIPSE / OVAL  (PlantUML usecase shape)
'    - Data store      : flat rectangle  (with D# prefix)
'    - Data flow       : straight / orthogonal arrow with label
'
'  Diagrams in this file:
'    1) Context Diagram (Level 0)            — Sơ đồ ngữ cảnh
'    2) Level 1                                — Mức đỉnh
'    3) Level 2 — P4. Sales Order Management
'    4) Level 2 — P5. Route Planning & Optimization
'    5) Level 2 — P6. Trip Execution & Monitoring
'    6) Level 2 — P10. AI Assistant
' =====================================================================


' =====================================================================
'  1) DFD CONTEXT (LEVEL 0)
' =====================================================================
@startuml DFD_Context
title <b>DFD Context Diagram (Level 0)</b>\n<i>Sơ đồ ngữ cảnh — Hệ thống quản lý vận tải đường bộ</i>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.1
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam nodesep 45

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor     #000000
  BorderThickness 1.3
  FontStyle       bold
  FontSize        12
  RoundCorner     0
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor     #000000
  BorderThickness 1.3
  FontStyle       bold
  FontSize        13
}

' --- External entities (Tác nhân ngoài) ---
rectangle "Administrator / Dispatcher\n(Quản trị / Điều phối)"   as ADMIN
rectangle "Driver\n(Tài xế — Mobile App)"                        as DRIVER
rectangle "Customer / Consignee\n(Khách hàng / Người nhận)"      as CUSTOMER
rectangle "Support Agent\n(Tư vấn viên hỗ trợ)"                   as SUPPORT
rectangle "Optimizer Service\n(OR-Tools VRP)"                    as OPTIMIZER
rectangle "Gemini API\n(Google AI)"                              as GEMINI
rectangle "SMTP / Email Server\n(Gmail)"                          as SMTP

' --- Central process (Tiến trình trung tâm) ---
usecase "0\nRoad Freight TMS\n(Hệ thống quản lý\nvận tải đường bộ)" as TMS

' --- Layout hints: 3 entities on left, 4 on right ---
ADMIN     -[hidden]down- DRIVER
DRIVER    -[hidden]down- CUSTOMER
SUPPORT   -[hidden]down- OPTIMIZER
OPTIMIZER -[hidden]down- GEMINI
GEMINI    -[hidden]down- SMTP

' --- Data flows (Luồng dữ liệu) ---
ADMIN     --> TMS : Login, CRUD master data,\norders, plans, optimization\n(Đăng nhập, CRUD đơn / KH)
TMS       --> ADMIN : Dashboard, lists, Excel reports\n(Dashboard, danh sách, báo cáo)

DRIVER    --> TMS : GPS, ePOD, signature, trip status,\nincident (GPS, ePOD, trạng thái)
TMS       --> DRIVER : Assigned trip, route, notifications\n(Chuyến giao, lộ trình, thông báo)

CUSTOMER  --> TMS : Tracking code, chatbot Q,\ncontact info (Mã đơn, câu hỏi)
TMS       --> CUSTOMER : Order status, chatbot reply,\nconfirmation email (Trạng thái, email)

TMS       --> SUPPORT : Hand-off email + chat history\n(Email bàn giao + lịch sử)
SUPPORT   --> TMS : Reply via magic-link\n(Trả lời ticket)

TMS       --> OPTIMIZER : VRP request — orders, vehicles,\ndepot, constraints (Yêu cầu tối ưu VRP)
OPTIMIZER --> TMS : Optimized routes + KPIs\n(Lộ trình tối ưu)

TMS       --> GEMINI : Prompt + function declarations\n(Lệnh + khai báo function)
GEMINI    --> TMS : Function call / text answer\n(Function call / câu trả lời)

TMS       --> SMTP : Notification email, magic-link\n(Email thông báo)
SMTP      --> TMS : Delivery status\n(Trạng thái gửi)

@enduml


' =====================================================================
'  2) DFD LEVEL 1 — System decomposition
' =====================================================================
@startuml DFD_Level1
title <b>DFD Level 1 — Main Processes of TMS</b>\n<i>Biểu đồ luồng dữ liệu mức đỉnh</i>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam nodesep 35

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<external>>  #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<external>>      #000000
  BorderThickness<<external>>  1.2
  FontStyle<<external>>        bold
  RoundCorner<<external>>      0

  BackgroundColor<<store>>     #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<store>>         #000000
  BorderThickness<<store>>     1.2
  FontStyle<<store>>           bold
  RoundCorner<<store>>         0
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor<<process>>   #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<process>>       #000000
  BorderThickness<<process>>   1.2
  FontStyle<<process>>         bold
}

' --- External entities ---
rectangle "Admin / Dispatcher\n(Quản trị / Điều phối)"   as ADMIN  <<external>>
rectangle "Driver\n(Tài xế)"                              as DRIVER <<external>>
rectangle "Customer\n(Khách hàng)"                        as CUST   <<external>>
rectangle "Support Agent\n(Tư vấn viên)"                  as SUPP   <<external>>
rectangle "OR-Tools Optimizer"                            as OPT    <<external>>
rectangle "Gemini API"                                    as GEM    <<external>>
rectangle "SMTP Email"                                    as SMTP   <<external>>

' --- Processes (ellipses) — 10 processes, khớp với 10 nhóm BFD ---
usecase "1.0\nSystem Administration\n(Quản trị hệ thống —\nAuth, Org, User, Role,\nAudit, Config)"     as P1  <<process>>
usecase "2.0\nMaster Data\nManagement\n(Quản lý danh mục)"                                              as P2  <<process>>
usecase "3.0\nSales Order\nManagement\n(Quản lý đơn hàng)"                                              as P3  <<process>>
usecase "4.0\nRoute Planning\n& Optimization\n(Lập kế hoạch & Tối ưu)"                                  as P4  <<process>>
usecase "5.0\nTrip Execution\n& Monitoring\n(Điều hành & Giám sát chuyến)"                              as P5  <<process>>
usecase "6.0\nVehicle\nMaintenance\n(Bảo dưỡng phương tiện)"                                            as P6  <<process>>
usecase "7.0\nDriver Payroll\n(Tính lương tài xế)"                                                       as P7  <<process>>
usecase "8.0\nReporting\n& Accounting\n(Báo cáo & Kế toán)"                                             as P8  <<process>>
usecase "9.0\nAI Assistant\n(Trợ lý AI)"                                                                 as P9  <<process>>
usecase "10.0\nCustomer Support\n(Hỗ trợ khách hàng)"                                                    as P10 <<process>>

' --- Data stores (flat rectangles) ---
rectangle "D1. Users & RoleGroup\n(Người dùng & Vai trò)"               as D1  <<store>>
rectangle "D2. Organization\n(Tổ chức)"                                  as D2  <<store>>
rectangle "D3. Master Data\n(Customer/Product/Vehicle/Driver/Service)" as D3  <<store>>
rectangle "D4. SalesOrder\n(Đơn hàng)"                                  as D4  <<store>>
rectangle "D5. RoutePlan & DeliveryRoute\n(Kế hoạch & Tuyến giao)"      as D5  <<store>>
rectangle "D6. Trip & OrderTripAllocation\n(Chuyến & Phân bổ đơn)"      as D6  <<store>>
rectangle "D7. GpsLog\n(Nhật ký GPS)"                                    as D7  <<store>>
rectangle "D8. TripIncident\n(Sự cố chuyến)"                            as D8  <<store>>
rectangle "D9. VehicleMaintenance\n(Bảo dưỡng xe)"                      as D9  <<store>>
rectangle "D10. PayrollConfig\n(Cấu hình lương)"                         as D10 <<store>>
rectangle "D11. AuditLog\n(Nhật ký kiểm toán)"                           as D11 <<store>>
rectangle "D12. Notification, DriverMessage,\nChatSession (Thông báo, Tin nhắn, Chat)" as D12 <<store>>
rectangle "D13. SupportArticle\n(Bài viết hỗ trợ — KB)"                  as D13 <<store>>

' =========================================================
'  DATA FLOWS (Luồng dữ liệu)
' =========================================================

' --- 1.0 System Administration (Auth + Org + User + Role + Audit + Config) ---
ADMIN  --> P1 : Credentials, manage org tree,\nusers, roles, config\n(Đăng nhập, quản trị hệ thống)
DRIVER --> P1 : Credentials (Tài khoản)
SUPP   --> P1 : Magic-link token
P1 --> ADMIN  : JWT, dashboard quản trị
P1 --> DRIVER : JWT + user info
P1 <--> D1    : R/W users & roles\n(Đọc/ghi user & vai trò)
P1 <--> D2    : R/W organization tree\n(Cây tổ chức)
P1 <--> D11   : R/W audit log\n(Nhật ký kiểm toán)

' --- 2.0 Master Data ---
ADMIN <--> P2 : CRUD Customer/Product/Vehicle/\nDriver/Service (CRUD danh mục)
P2 <--> D3
P2 --> D11 : Audit log

' --- 3.0 Sales Order ---
ADMIN --> P3 : Create / approve / cancel,\nimport Excel (Tạo / duyệt / hủy)
P3 --> ADMIN : Order list (Danh sách đơn)
CUST  --> P3 : Tracking code (Mã đơn)
P3 --> CUST  : Order status (Trạng thái)
P3 <--> D4
P3 -->  D3   : Read customer, product (Đọc danh mục)
P3 --> D11   : Audit log

' --- 4.0 Route Planning & Optimization ---
ADMIN <--> P4 : Plan, assign, optimize, lock\n(Lập kế hoạch & Tối ưu)
P4 --> OPT    : Orders + vehicles + constraints\n(Đầu vào VRP)
OPT --> P4    : Optimized route (Lộ trình tối ưu)
P4 <--> D5
P4 -->  D4    : Read / lock orders (Đọc / khóa đơn)
P4 -->  D3    : Read vehicle, driver (Đọc xe, tài xế)
P4 --> D11    : Audit log

' --- 5.0 Trip Execution & Monitoring ---
P4 --> P5     : Finalized plan => Trip (Plan => Trip)
DRIVER --> P5 : Confirm, GPS, ePOD, incident,\nmessages (Cập nhật chuyến)
P5 --> DRIVER : Assigned trip, notifications\n(Chuyến giao, thông báo)
ADMIN <--> P5 : Live dispatch, incident handling\n(Realtime, xử lý sự cố)
P5 <--> D6
P5 <--> D7    : GPS read/write
P5 <--> D8    : Incident read/write
P5 -->  D4    : Order status = DELIVERED
P5 -->  D12   : Notification & message
P5 -->  SMTP  : ePOD email (Email cho khách)
P5 --> D11    : Audit log

' --- 6.0 Vehicle Maintenance ---
ADMIN <--> P6 : Schedule / alerts (Lên lịch / cảnh báo)
DRIVER --> P6 : Confirm completion (Xác nhận hoàn tất)
P6 --> DRIVER : Maintenance notification
P6 <--> D9
P6 -->  D3    : Read vehicle
P6 -->  D12   : Notification
P6 --> D11    : Audit log

' --- 7.0 Payroll ---
ADMIN <--> P7 : Payroll config / view (Cấu hình / xem)
P7 <--> D10
P7 -->  D6    : Read completed trips
P7 -->  D3    : Read driver
P7 --> D11    : Audit log

' --- 8.0 Reporting ---
ADMIN <--> P8 : Report request, Excel file
P8 -->  D4    : Read orders
P8 -->  D6    : Read trips
P8 -->  D5    : Read plans
P8 -->  D3    : Read master data

' --- 9.0 AI Assistant ---
ADMIN <--> P9 : NL command / question\n(Câu lệnh / câu hỏi)
CUST  <--> P9 : Chatbot question
P9 <--> GEM   : Prompt + function / answer
P9 -->  SMTP  : Hand-off email
SMTP -->  SUPP : Magic-link email
P9 <--> D12   : ChatSession R/W
P9 -->  D13   : KB lookup (Tra cứu KB)
P9 -->  P3    : Function call (order)
P9 -->  P4    : Function call (plan)
P9 -->  P8    : Function call (report)

' --- 10.0 Customer Support ---
CUST   --> P10 : Contact form
P10 --> SMTP   : Admin notification
P10 <--> D13
SUPP   --> P10 : Ticket reply
P10 --> CUST   : Reply email

@enduml


' =====================================================================
'  3) DFD LEVEL 2 — P3. SALES ORDER MANAGEMENT
' =====================================================================
@startuml DFD_Level2_P3_Order
title <b>DFD Level 2 — P3.0 Sales Order Management</b>\n<i>Biểu đồ DFD "Quản lý Đơn hàng" mức 2</i>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam nodesep 35

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<external>>  #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<external>>      #000000
  BorderThickness<<external>>  1.2
  FontStyle<<external>>        bold
  RoundCorner<<external>>      0

  BackgroundColor<<store>>     #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<store>>         #000000
  BorderThickness<<store>>     1.2
  FontStyle<<store>>           bold
  RoundCorner<<store>>         0
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor<<process>>   #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<process>>       #000000
  BorderThickness<<process>>   1.2
  FontStyle<<process>>         bold
}

rectangle "Data Entry Staff\n(Nhân viên nhập liệu)"        as STAFF <<external>>
rectangle "Manager / Approver\n(Trưởng phòng / Phê duyệt)" as APPR  <<external>>
rectangle "Dispatcher\n(Điều phối)"                        as DISP  <<external>>
rectangle "Customer (public)\n(Khách hàng)"                as CUST  <<external>>
rectangle "AI Agent (9.0)\n(Trợ lý AI)"                    as AI    <<external>>
rectangle "Process 4.0\nRoute Planning"                    as P5EXT <<external>>
rectangle "Process 5.0\nTrip Execution"                    as P6EXT <<external>>

usecase "3.1\nOrder Entry\n(Manual / Mobile)\n(Nhập đơn)"           as P41 <<process>>
usecase "3.2\nExcel Import\n(Import Excel)"                         as P42 <<process>>
usecase "3.3\nOrder Approval\n(Duyệt đơn)"                          as P43 <<process>>
usecase "3.4\nUpdate / Cancel\n(Cập nhật / Hủy)"                    as P44 <<process>>
usecase "3.5\nChange Planning Status\n(Đổi trạng thái Planning)"    as P45 <<process>>
usecase "3.6\nAllocate Order to Trip\n(Phân bổ vào Trip)"           as P46 <<process>>
usecase "3.7\nPublic Tracking\n(Tra cứu công khai)"                 as P47 <<process>>

rectangle "D3. Master Data\n(Customer, Product)" as D3  <<store>>
rectangle "D4. SalesOrder\n(Đơn hàng)"           as D4  <<store>>
rectangle "D6. Trip &\nOrderTripAllocation"     as D6  <<store>>
rectangle "D11. AuditLog"                       as D11 <<store>>

STAFF --> P41 : Order info — customer, product,\nstop, time (Thông tin đơn)
P41 -->  D3   : Validate KH, SP
P41 -->  D4   : Write SalesOrder (PENDING)
P41 -->  D11

STAFF --> P42 : Excel file
P42 -->  D3   : Map mã KH / SP
P42 -->  D4   : Bulk insert
P42 --> STAFF : Success / error report (Báo cáo lỗi)
P42 -->  D11

APPR  --> P43 : Approve / reject + reason\n(Quyết định + lý do)
P43 -->  D4   : APPROVED / REJECTED
P43 -->  D11

DISP  --> P44 : Edit / cancel (Sửa / hủy)
AI    --> P44 : Function call (update / cancel)
P44 -->  D4   : Update / soft-delete
P44 --> P5EXT : Cancelled => remove from plan
P44 -->  D11

P5EXT --> P45 : PLANNED / LOCKED / FINALIZED
P6EXT --> P45 : DELIVERED (after ePOD)
P45 -->  D4   : Update planningStatus

P5EXT --> P46 : Allocation request
P46 -->  D6   : Write OrderTripAllocation
P46 -->  D4   : Read order

CUST  --> P47 : Tracking code (Mã đơn)
P47 -->  D4   : Read status
P47 -->  D6   : Read trip
P47 --> CUST  : Status + ETA + driver + map

@enduml


' =====================================================================
'  4) DFD LEVEL 2 — P4. ROUTE PLANNING & OPTIMIZATION
' =====================================================================
@startuml DFD_Level2_P4_Planning
title <b>DFD Level 2 — P4.0 Route Planning & Optimization</b>\n<i>Biểu đồ DFD "Lập kế hoạch & Tối ưu lộ trình" mức 2</i>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam nodesep 35

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<external>>  #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<external>>      #000000
  BorderThickness<<external>>  1.2
  FontStyle<<external>>        bold
  RoundCorner<<external>>      0

  BackgroundColor<<store>>     #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<store>>         #000000
  BorderThickness<<store>>     1.2
  FontStyle<<store>>           bold
  RoundCorner<<store>>         0
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor<<process>>   #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<process>>       #000000
  BorderThickness<<process>>   1.2
  FontStyle<<process>>         bold
}

rectangle "Dispatcher / Manager\n(Điều phối / Quản lý)" as DISP  <<external>>
rectangle "OR-Tools\nOptimizer Service"                 as OPT   <<external>>
rectangle "AI Agent (9.0)"                              as AI    <<external>>
rectangle "Process 3.0\nSales Order"                    as P4EXT <<external>>
rectangle "Process 5.0\nTrip Execution"                 as P6EXT <<external>>

usecase "4.1\nCreate / Edit /\nDelete RoutePlan\n(Tạo / Sửa / Xoá)" as P51 <<process>>
usecase "4.2\nManage DeliveryRoute\n(Quản lý tuyến)"                 as P52 <<process>>
usecase "4.3\nAssign / Move / Reorder\nOrders in Route\n(Gán / Di chuyển)" as P53 <<process>>
usecase "4.4\nAssign Driver / Vehicle /\n3PL / Cost\n(Gán Tài xế / Xe)" as P54 <<process>>
usecase "4.5\nVRP Optimization\n(OR-Tools)\n(Tối ưu VRP)"           as P55 <<process>>
usecase "4.6\nAuto-Dispatch Driver\n(Tự động điều phối)"            as P56 <<process>>
usecase "4.7\nLock / Unlock /\nFinalize Route\n(Khóa / Hoàn thiện)" as P57 <<process>>
usecase "4.8\nSync Plan => Create Trip\n(Sync Plan => Tạo Trip)"    as P58 <<process>>
usecase "4.9\nBenchmark Result\n(So sánh tối ưu)"                    as P59 <<process>>

rectangle "D3. Master Data\n(Vehicle, Driver, Service)" as D3  <<store>>
rectangle "D4. SalesOrder"                              as D4  <<store>>
rectangle "D5. RoutePlan &\nDeliveryRoute"              as D5  <<store>>
rectangle "D6. Trip"                                    as D6  <<store>>
rectangle "D11. AuditLog"                               as D11 <<store>>

DISP --> P51 : Plan by date / region\n(Theo ngày / vùng)
AI   --> P51 : Function call (create)
P51 <--> D5
P51 --> D11

DISP --> P52 : Add / remove route\n(Thêm / xoá tuyến)
P52 <--> D5
P52 --> D11

DISP --> P53 : Drag-drop order (Kéo thả đơn)
P53 -->  D4  : Read weight / volume\n(Đọc tải)
P53 <--> D5
P53 --> DISP : Constraint violation\n(Cảnh báo vi phạm)
P53 --> D11

DISP --> P54 : Pick vehicle / driver / 3PL /\ncost (Chọn xe / tài xế)
P54 -->  D3  : Read available
P54 <--> D5
P54 --> D11

DISP --> P55 : Optimize request + params\n(Yêu cầu tối ưu)
P55 -->  D4  : Read unplanned orders
P55 -->  D3  : Read vehicle / driver
P55 -->  OPT : VRP payload
OPT  --> P55 : Optimized route + KPI
P55 <--> D5  : Save optimized routes
P55 --> P59  : Trigger benchmark
P55 --> D11

DISP --> P56 : Auto-dispatch request
P56 -->  D3  : Read driver + workload
P56 -->  D6  : Read trip history
P56 <--> D5  : Assign driver
P56 --> DISP : Assigned / skipped report
P56 --> D11

DISP --> P57 : Lock / Unlock / Finalize
P57 <--> D5  : Update route status
P57 -->  D4  : Update planning status
P57 --> P58  : Trigger on FINALIZED
P57 --> D11

P58 -->  D5  : Read finalized routes
P58 -->  D4  : Read orders in route
P58 <--> D6  : Create Trip + allocations
P58 --> P6EXT : Hand over Trip
P58 --> D11

P59 -->  D5  : Read optimized routes
P59 --> DISP : Comparison table\n(Bảng so sánh)

P4EXT --> P53 : APPROVED orders\nwithout route
P4EXT --> P55 : APPROVED orders\nfor VRP input

@enduml


' =====================================================================
'  5) DFD LEVEL 2 — P5. TRIP EXECUTION & MONITORING
' =====================================================================
@startuml DFD_Level2_P5_Trip
title <b>DFD Level 2 — P5.0 Trip Execution & Monitoring</b>\n<i>Biểu đồ DFD "Điều hành & Giám sát chuyến" mức 2</i>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam nodesep 35

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<external>>  #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<external>>      #000000
  BorderThickness<<external>>  1.2
  FontStyle<<external>>        bold
  RoundCorner<<external>>      0

  BackgroundColor<<store>>     #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<store>>         #000000
  BorderThickness<<store>>     1.2
  FontStyle<<store>>           bold
  RoundCorner<<store>>         0
}
