usecase "5.9\nIncident Reporting\n(Báo cáo sự cố)"        as P69  <<process>>
usecase "5.10\nDriver Messaging\n(Tin nhắn)"               as P610 <<process>>
usecase "5.11\nLive Dispatch Map\n(Bản đồ realtime)"      as P611 <<process>>
usecase "5.12\nHandle Incident\n(Xử lý sự cố)"             as P612 <<process>>

rectangle "D4. SalesOrder"                       as D4  <<store>>
rectangle "D6. Trip &\nOrderTripAllocation"     as D6  <<store>>
rectangle "D7. GpsLog"                           as D7  <<store>>
rectangle "D8. TripIncident"                     as D8  <<store>>
rectangle "D12. Notification &\nDriverMessage"  as D12 <<store>>
rectangle "D11. AuditLog"                        as D11 <<store>>

P5EXT  --> P61 : New trip created
P61 -->  D6   : Status = CONFIRMED
P61 -->  D12  : Notification dispatcher
P61 -->  D11

DRIVER --> P62 : Start loading
P62 -->  D6   : Status = LOADING
P62 --> DRIVER : Picking list (Danh sách kiện)
P62 -->  D11

DRIVER --> P63 : Pickup / start trip
