P63 --> SMTP  : "In delivery" email
P63 -->  D11

DRIVER --> P64 : (lat, lng, speed, ts)
P64 -->  D7   : Append GPS log
P64 -->  P611 : Socket.IO stream

DRIVER --> P65 : arrive / deliver / failed +\nphoto + signature
P65 -->  D6   : Task by stopIndex
P65 -->  D4   : DELIVERED / FAILED
P65 --> SMTP  : ePOD email
SMTP  --> CUST : ePOD email
P65 --> P66   : If deviation (Nếu lệch)
P65 -->  D11

DRIVER --> P66 : Reason + evidence
P66 <--> GEM  : Analysis + suggest
