DISP <--> P611 : Real-time map +\ntrip progress
P611 -->  D6  : Read trip
P611 -->  D7  : Read latest GPS
P611 -->  D8  : Read open incidents

DISP --> P612 : Resolve / close incident
P612 <--> D8  : Update incident
P612 -->  D12 : Notification to driver
P612 -->  D11

